1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,200
Lemari ini terkubur hampir 2.000 tahun...

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,160
dan isinya tak tersentuh!

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,900
Arkeolog Pompeii baru saja mengungkapnya.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:08,710
Pinset,

5
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:09,800
alat rias,

6
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,160
botol parfum...

7
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,160
dan 38 koin.

8
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,260
Pemiliknya...

9
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,780
tak sempat membawanya.

10
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,090
Di kantong kain...

11
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:19,470
ada kalung 24 jimat anak.

12
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:20,690
Milik siapa?

13
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:21,840
Diduga...

14
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,950
jimat masa kecil pemiliknya sendiri,

15
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,610
disimpan sampai dewasa.

16
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,940
Kamu masih simpan barang masa kecil apa?

17
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,640
Jawab di komentar!
